Modifications by Vizuara (2026):

This fork contains modifications specifically for SO-101 robot users on Windows,
including:

1. Windows Compatibility Improvements
   - Modified camera timeout handling (src/lerobot/cameras/opencv/camera_opencv.py)
   - Increased motor communication timeout (src/lerobot/motors/feetech/feetech.py)
   - Removed unsupported camera backend parameters for Windows

2. Hardware-Specific Fixes
   - SO-101 Motor 5 encoder bit-15 workaround
   - Modified timeout values for USB hub compatibility
   - Enhanced error handling for Windows serial communication

3. Documentation Enhancements
   - Complete tutorial series for SO-101 setup and usage
   - Detailed hardware setup guides with Windows-specific instructions
   - USB cable and hub compatibility documentation
   - Comprehensive troubleshooting guides

4. Custom Scripts and Tools
   - Motor diagnostic and calibration utilities
   - Camera testing and configuration tools
   - Dataset recording helpers

For detailed list of modifications, see: MODIFICATIONS.md

